<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Elastomeric Q1 net up 49 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Elastomeric Q1 net up 49 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results for the three months ended June 30, 1996:</p>
<p>		 (in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				 Q1 96/97	    Q1 95/96</p>
<p>    Turnover		  61.66     vs	 51.25</p>
<p>    Net profit		 8.64     vs	  5.80</p>
<p>    Tax provision	    0.80     vs	  4.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Elastomeric Engineering Co Ltd manufactures and exports rubber-based products. A company statement gave no reason for the sharp profit increase.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
